.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt KLDLOAD-DESKTOP 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kldload-desktop
.Nd the programs behind kldload's desktop icons, first-boot screens and live appliances
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These run from icons, autostart entries and services rather than being
typed; each answers
.Fl -help .
.Ss Opening the web console
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Xr kldload-dashboard 8
The whole console as an application window.
.It Xr kldload-win 8
One view of it as its own window.
.It Nm kldload-chrome-app
Opens a console view as a Chrome application window in a profile of its
own, with the window class the dock needs for the right icon.
.It Nm kldload-webview
The same with a native GTK and WebKit window, on Wayland.
.It Nm kldload-webui-launch
Waits up to a minute for the console to answer after login, then opens it.
.El
.Ss Terminals
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Nm kldload-term
Opens whichever terminal the distribution ships \(em ptyxis, the GNOME
console, gnome-terminal \(em with kldload's tools on the path.
.It Nm kldload-sysdiag-launch , Nm kldload-mok-repair-launch
Open
.Xr kldload-sysdiag 8
and
.Xr kldload-mok-repair 8
in a terminal window.
.El
.Ss First boot and install
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Nm kldload-firstboot-show
Holds the screen with a show while first boot builds what the install
asked for, and hands over the desktop when it has finished; it decides
per boot whether there is anything to wait for.
.It Nm kldload-install-kiosk
Puts the install show on the screen without a desktop session, when the
kernel command line asks for the kiosk.
.It Nm kldload-build-monitor-autostart
Opens
.Xr kldload-build-monitor 8
at login only while the machine is still building.
.It Xr kldload-tty1 8
The first text console: the install menu on the live medium when asked
for, a login otherwise.
.El
.Ss Appliances
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Nm kldload-firstboot-landing
At the first boot of a landing-zone node, sets up an SFTP-only drop zone:
each user confined to a ZFS dataset of their own under
.Pa rpool/srv/landing ,
encrypted by default.
.It Nm bob-live , Nm bob-splash
On a live image built as the AI appliance, start the assistant, Ollama
and Open WebUI already in the image, and show a page of hardware and
progress until they are ready.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kldload-snapshots 7 ,
